menu "Live vibration analysis"
    config LIVE_ANALYSIS_ENABLED
        bool "Enable estimated live synchronous 1x analysis"
        depends on V0_OPTICAL_ENABLED
        default n
        help
            Uses independent raw/reference queues and a bounded PSRAM window.
            FIFO sample clock and GPIO polling reference remain unqualified;
            all live results are estimates and cannot authorize balancing.
endmenu
